{"ref":"BDB, תַּלְמַי","hw":"תַּלְמַי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תַּלְמַי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  king of Geshur, father-in-law of David, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.3\">2 S 3:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:37\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.37\">13:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.2\">1 Ch 3:2</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a son of ʿAnaḳ <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:22\" href=\"/Numbers.13.22\">Nu 13:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:14\" href=\"/Joshua.15.14\">Jos 15:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּלְמָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:10\" href=\"/Judges.1.10\">Ju 1:10</a>; Θομμει, Θολμει, Θαλαμειν, etc.","next":"BDB, תַּלְמִיד²","prev":"BDB, תֶּ֫לֶם"}